Medini The Eco Store is located in Duler, Mapusa-Goa.

&nbsp;

This store was started with the vision &amp; mission to reduce the single-use of plastic and to inculcate an eco-friendly living habit at an ideal and economic price.   It is truly a one stop-shop, where you’ll find a variety of good quality eco-friendly products such as handmade wooden craft, single-use bagasse food containers, organic body care essentials, ecofemme products, stationery, jewellery and many more items at a very inexpensive rate.

Their key products is their jute and cotton bags which can be customised as per your requirements in different shapes and sizes, that can be used by yourself or can be gifted to your
friends and family.

